{"schemaVersion":1,"framework":"agnostic","version":"v0","id":"quick-start","title":"Quick start","description":"Require installed conventions for the work an agent performs in your project.","body":[{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["Point your project's agent instructions at the installed skills to require them\nbefore applicable work. Keep your existing project rules when adding these links."]},"\n",{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["In this guide you will:"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[["\n",{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":["Install the conventions you need."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":["Add task-specific requirements to your agent instructions."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":["Check that the agent can read the installed resources."]},"\n"]]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:h2","props":{"id":"install-the-conventions"},"children":["Install the conventions"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":[["Follow ",{"tag":"mdx:a","props":{"href":"installation.md"},"children":["Installation"]}," from the project root. The example below\nassumes every skill is installed in ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":[".agents/skills/"]},"."]]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:h2","props":{"id":"add-project-instructions"},"children":["Add project instructions"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":[["Merge this section into your project's ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["AGENTS.md"]}," or equivalent instruction file:"]]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:pre","props":{"className":"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark","style":{"--shiki-light":"#24292e","--shiki-dark":"#e1e4e8","--shiki-light-bg":"#fff","--shiki-dark-bg":"#24292e"},"tabIndex":"0","icon":"<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M 6,1 C 4.354992,1 3,2.354992 3,4 v 16 c 0,1.645008 1.354992,3 3,3 h 12 c 1.645008,0 3,-1.354992 3,-3 V 8 7 A 1.0001,1.0001 0 0 0 20.707031,6.2929687 l -5,-5 A 1.0001,1.0001 0 0 0 15,1 h -1 z m 0,2 h 7 v 3 c 0,1.645008 1.354992,3 3,3 h 3 v 11 c 0,0.564129 -0.435871,1 -1,1 H 6 C 5.4358712,21 5,20.564129 5,20 V 4 C 5,3.4358712 5.4358712,3 6,3 Z M 15,3.4140625 18.585937,7 H 16 C 15.435871,7 15,6.5641288 15,6 Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" /></svg>"},"children":[{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":[[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"line"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["## Required conventions"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"line"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[null]}]},"\n",{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"line"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Read the applicable skill before starting work:"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"line"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[null]}]},"\n",{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"line"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["- Naming or renaming: [.agents/skills/jf-naming-conventions/SKILL.md](.agents/skills/jf-naming-conventions/SKILL.md)."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"line"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["- Implementing or reviewing code: [.agents/skills/jf-coding-conventions/SKILL.md](.agents/skills/jf-coding-conventions/SKILL.md)."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"line"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["- Git decisions: [.agents/skills/jf-git/SKILL.md](.agents/skills/jf-git/SKILL.md)."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"line"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["- Library documentation: [.agents/skills/jf-docs/SKILL.md](.agents/skills/jf-docs/SKILL.md)."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"line"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[null]}]},"\n",{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"line"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Read relevant repository instructions first. Preserve existing user changes."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"line"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["These skills do not authorize commits, pushes, publishing, or deployments."]}]}]]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["Adjust the paths if your installation uses another location, and include only the\nskills you installed. Record project-specific exceptions alongside your project\nrules so agents can apply them before shared defaults."]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:h2","props":{"id":"check-discovery"},"children":["Check discovery"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":[["Confirm each linked ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["SKILL.md"]}," exists and that ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["jf-git/references/"]}," contains its\nsupporting Markdown files. ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["jf-docs"]}," loads the other ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["jf-docs-*"]}," skills from the\nsame directory, so confirm those are installed next to it. Ask your agent to identify the applicable skill and\nread it before a matching task, such as naming a helper or editing a guide."]]},"\n",{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["Explicit instruction links help make the requirement clear, but native skill\ndiscovery still depends on your agent's configuration."]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:h2","props":{"id":"next-steps"},"children":["Next steps"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[["\n",{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[[{"tag":"mdx:a","props":{"href":"guides/choose-skills.md"},"children":["Understand each skill's scope"]},"."]]},"\n",{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[[{"tag":"mdx:a","props":{"href":"guides/troubleshooting.md"},"children":["Troubleshoot missing instructions"]},"."]]},"\n"]]}],"toc":[{"title":"Install the conventions","url":"#install-the-conventions","depth":2},{"title":"Add project instructions","url":"#add-project-instructions","depth":2},{"title":"Check discovery","url":"#check-discovery","depth":2},{"title":"Next steps","url":"#next-steps","depth":2}]}